{% assign product_handle = settings.product_handle | default: 'the-highly-sensitive-person-how-to-thrive-when-the-world-overwhelms-you' %}
{% assign product = all_products[product_handle] %}
{% assign primary_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant %}

<section class="hsp-hero" id="top">
  <div class="hsp-hero__copy">
    <p class="hsp-eyebrow">National Bestseller · Psychology Classic</p>
    <h1>The Highly Sensitive Person: How to Thrive When the World Overwhelms You</h1>
    <p class="hsp-lede">Elaine N. Aron, PhD, maps out a calm, science-backed path for Highly Sensitive People to protect their energy, set compassionate boundaries, and feel seen in a loud world.</p>
    <div class="hsp-rating-row">
      <span class="hsp-pill">⭐ 4.5/5 · 10,498 reviews</span>
      <span class="hsp-pill">Goodreads 3.8 · 53,848 ratings</span>
      <span class="hsp-pill">Trusted by therapists & readers</span>
    </div>
    <div class="hsp-cta-group">
      {% if product != blank and primary_variant %}
        {% form 'product', product, id: 'hero-buy-now' %}
          <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ primary_variant.id }}">
          <button type="submit" name="checkout" class="hsp-btn hsp-btn-primary">Buy Now — {{ primary_variant.price | money_without_trailing_zeros }}</button>
        {% endform %}
      {% else %}
        <a class="hsp-btn hsp-btn-primary" href="/products/{{ product_handle }}">Buy Now — $17</a>
      {% endif %}
      <p class="hsp-urgency">Free U.S. shipping · Ships in 24 hours · 30-day returns</p>
      <div class="hsp-badges">
        <span>✔ Paperback + Kindle friendly</span>
        <span>✔ Includes HSP self-assessment</span>
        <span>✔ Gentle, research-backed tools</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hsp-hero__image">
    <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0989/7020/6389/files/81C1VUgFP_L._SL1500.jpg?v=1765371942" alt="Cover of The Highly Sensitive Person book" loading="eager">
    <div class="hsp-countdown" data-countdown-hours="48">
      <p>Limited-time bonus</p>
      <div class="hsp-countdown__timer" id="hsp-countdown-timer">48:00:00</div>
      <p class="hsp-subtle">Free reflection worksheet with every order</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="hsp-reviews">
  <div class="hsp-reviews__bar">
    <div class="hsp-review-score">
      <strong>4.5</strong>
      <span>10,498 reviews</span>
    </div>
    <div class="hsp-review-score">
      <strong>3.8</strong>
      <span>Goodreads · 53,848 ratings</span>
    </div>
    <div class="hsp-review-score">
      <strong>National Bestseller</strong>
      <span>Psychology classic</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="hsp-pain">
  <div class="hsp-section-heading">
    <p class="hsp-eyebrow">For sensitive nervous systems</p>
    <h2>Does the world feel too loud?</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="hsp-pain__grid">
    <div class="hsp-pain__card">
      <h3>Overstimulated by everyday life</h3>
      <p>Bright lights, tight deadlines, and crowded rooms leave you drained faster than everyone else—and you wonder if something is wrong with you.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hsp-pain__card">
      <h3>People-pleasing to keep the peace</h3>
      <p>You struggle to say no, absorb everyone’s moods, and end up exhausted from carrying emotional weight that isn’t yours.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hsp-pain__card">
      <h3>Relationships that miss your depth</h3>
      <p>You crave understanding and calm, but partners or colleagues see your sensitivity as “too much” instead of a strength.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="hsp-learn">
  <div class="hsp-section-heading">
    <p class="hsp-eyebrow">Inside the book</p>
    <h2>What you'll learn</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="hsp-learn__list">
    <div class="hsp-learn__item">How to recognize and honor your Highly Sensitive Person trait without shame.</div>
    <div class="hsp-learn__item">Daily routines that prevent overstimulation and help you reset quickly.</div>
    <div class="hsp-learn__item">Scripts to explain your needs to partners, friends, and managers with confidence.</div>
    <div class="hsp-learn__item">Boundary templates that feel kind, firm, and doable.</div>
    <div class="hsp-learn__item">Science-backed coping tools for anxiety, conflict, and sensory overload.</div>
    <div class="hsp-learn__item">How to turn sensitivity into creativity, empathy, and leadership strengths.</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="hsp-testimonials">
