    </article>
    <article class="hsp-testimonial">
      <p class="hsp-quote">“If you even think you might be an HSP, this book gently answers the questions you’ve carried for years.”</p>
      <p class="hsp-author">— Jeannie</p>
    </article>
    <article class="hsp-testimonial">
      <p class="hsp-quote">“Explains sensitivity as a strength. I wish everyone would read this.”</p>
