      <p class="hsp-eyebrow">Psychology authority</p>
      <h2>Meet Elaine N. Aron, PhD</h2>
      <p>Dr. Aron is a clinical psychologist, pioneering researcher, and the first to name the Highly Sensitive Person trait. Her compassionate research has reached millions and is recommended by therapists worldwide.</p>
      <ul class="hsp-bullets">
        <li>30+ years researching sensitivity and temperament</li>
